    "description": "Wallhaven wallpapers for the DeepSeek Harness web GUI: search wallhaven.cc from a settings page, wear any result as the shell background (with opacity/blur/scrim controls), and download the original to disk. The host half fetches everything, so the browser never has to reach wallhaven — which matters behind a proxy or a poisoned DNS.",
